                                "sense_id": "5fc8a8ba-1250-3677-af85-4c1acee91fcb",
                                "text": "We quoted a month or two back some amusing verses from Punch poking fun at child study, pædometry and the new faddists; but it is easy to turn the tables and show the nauseating diet that was provided for children of the early Victorian age when Froebelian methods were unknown."
                            }
